## 7. Rollback

- **§1** — restore `test_send` / `test_alert` to the single `tests` array and delete the guard block. Nothing else depends on it.
- **§2** — delete the one `writeHealth_(blankHealth_('collect-start', now))` line. Existing `collect-start` rows are inert; leave them, they are evidence.
- **§3** — delete the three brackets and the `notes.push`; move the `health.notes` assignment back above `appendPool_`.

The three are independent. §1 touching `src/Test.gs` only and §2/§3 touching `src/Collect.gs` only means a failure in either does not implicate the other.

