## 8. Do not

- Do not edit `src/Config.gs`, including `LIMITS.titleSimilarity` and `LIMITS.poolDays`.
- Do not set `DRY_RUN` to `'true'` at any point, for any reason, including to run the suite.
- Do not write a health row from the `tryLock` early-return branch.
- Do not add `pruneHealth_` or any other `health`-tab pruner in this pass.
- Do not change dedup, prune, clustering, or mojibake logic. This spec measures; it does not optimise.
- Do not reassign `MailApp`, `SpreadsheetApp`, `LockService`, or any built-in service global.
- Do not add `diag_*` to `test_all`.
- Do not attach a GCP project as part of this work. See the gate in the header.
- Do not add `.md` files beyond this one. `docs/NOTES.md` and `.agent/notes/gotchas-apps-script.md` already exist; §5 appends to them.
- Do not `import` / `export` / `require` in `src/`.
- Do not call `new Date()` below `runNow()` / `collectNow()`. The clock stays injected — note that `Date.now()` in §3 measures elapsed duration, not wall-clock time, and does not violate this.
- Do not commit or push to git. `clasp push` only.

